---
module: task-manager
func_id: complete-task
---

***conformance tests***

# mark-a-task-as-completed
A :User: adds a :Task: named `Buy milk` and checks the checkbox of that :Task:. :TaskList: then shows the :Task: as completed.

# clear-the-completed-mark-of-a-task
A :User: adds a :Task: named `Buy milk`, checks the checkbox of that :Task: and checks it again. :TaskList: then shows the :Task: as not completed.

***acceptance tests***
